  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In case 1:<br />Conservation of linear momentum: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>mv</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>mv</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math><br />Conservation of mechanical energy: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mi>mv</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p><p>Here&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is the minimum energy required for the reaction to happen<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo> </mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math><br />In case 2:<br />Conservation of linear momentum: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>mv</mi><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>mv</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>⇒</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></msubsup></math><br />Conservation of mechanical energy: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></msubsup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></msubsup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msubsup><mi>mv</mi><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mi>mv</mi><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo> </mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mi>mv</mi><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo> </mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>mv</mi><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p>"
